{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big判X：X的大块直接交代了人物处境、原因和转折，Y只看加亮词组时，部分屏幕的因果关系和完整意思不容易恢复；small判Y：Y的小字有更多有效的细节补充，例如“外头像给众人看的舞步，心里却只哼自己的旧歌”“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”，辨识度较高，也能挂回主线。core判Y：Y更持续、明确地呈现怀念亲近与维护尊严之间的冲突，尤其S11至S13把不因害怕而退回、不为留住谁而咽下委屈交代得更清楚；concise判X：Y在S06、S08等处有主句和小字重复表达想念、暖意的情况，解释性文字也偏多。human判Y：X有“喘息又变成了悬心”“越猛地翻上来”“拥有这样的归属”等搭配不够自然，Y整体更符合日常表达，虽然“凭这点指望回去忍让”也略显生硬；fine判X：X的感受更集中于观众的身体和心理体验，如“后颈一凉、脉搏乱跳”“连呼吸都放轻”，Y则有较多对节奏、旋律本身的描述；load判Y：Y的大字短语虽然数量略多，但单块较短、意群边界清楚，结合停留时间更容易扫读。综合来看，Y在核心表达、语言自然度和实际扫读负担上占优。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c92e3599-23ac-4fc1-9994-eb86b9190db1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T045231578861Z", "elapsed_seconds": 274.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T04:57:06.318241+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d782031dff3633b211c6f7bb1cdddda08c5eb83a462fff531616edd64c8dfa4c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0,